docs {
  # API documentation endpoint tests (ONEROSTER-109)

  `ENABLE_SWAGGER_UI` and `ENABLE_OPEN_API_METADATA` govern whether `/docs` and
  `/swagger.json` are mounted. Both are served by default, and the E2E stacks leave them
  unset, so these requests assert the default: the endpoints are served through the
  deployed container.

  The value is in the delivery path rather than the logic. The compose files pass both
  variables straight through without supplying defaults of their own, so a wiring mistake
  there would disable the endpoints in Docker while every unit test still passed.

  The disabled cases are configuration variants and cannot be covered here: Bruno runs
  against one stack brought up from one `.env`. They belong in the app-level route tests
  tracked by ONEROSTER-73.

  Neither endpoint requires a token, so this folder does not inherit the collection auth.
}
